# macOS Finder 会在任何被浏览过的目录里生成它；客户端下载的正是本仓库归档，不该带上它。
.DS_Store
.release-artifacts/
.marketplace-build/
.tooling/
.gh-pages-wt/
abilities/plugins/*/dist/
abilities/plugins/*/release/
abilities/plugins/*/.payload/
dbx-pro.astravia-design
design-resources/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Test outputs (build engine / script artifacts)
output/
.pycache__/
ui-mock-dbx-bi-editor.astravia-design/history
ui-mock

# 上游参考源码（逆向与调研用，不参与发布）
tmp/
ui-mock

# 日报生成物与模板（本地排版用，不进仓库）
docs/daily-reports/

# 逆向产物（反编译的宿主 asar、探针脚本），永不入库
.re/

# Plugin sites: upstream web builds, produced at pack time by scripts/build-craft-web.mjs and by
# each plugin's own recipe (excalidraw: abilities/plugins/excalidraw/scripts/build-excalidraw-web.mjs).
# The latter unpacks the upstream tree under `.cache/` (a source checkout plus its node_modules),
# so that stays out of the archive.
.cache/
abilities/plugins/*/web/
